          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bezaleli mwana wa-Uri muzukulu wa-Huri waluzubo lwa-Juda nguwakacita zintu zyoonse Jehova nzyaakalailila Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
