              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kali antoomwe a-Aholiabu mwana waAhisamaki waluzubo lwa-Dani, similimo muuza, sikutunga masani aanyanzabili amasani aakamwemvwe amasani aasalala pyu amasani aatuba aalukidwe kabotu.",
