        },
        {
          "text": "Ingolida yoonse iyakabelesegwa mumilimo yakuyaka cikombelo, ingolida yamulumbo, yakali matalenta aali makumi obile amusanu aane amasyekeli aali myanda iili musanu aibili amakumi otatwe, mbubonya mbuli isyekeli lyacikombelo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.24",
